 "words_heard": 261,
 "words": 263,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A daughter of Levi in Egypt lived",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amram married her, the covenant kept",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She bore Aaron and Miriam too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses came when the decree stood",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The king commanded to kill the boys",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But she saw the beauty of the child's face",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She hid him for three full months",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not afraid of the king's heavy command",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith stood strong in the land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When she could hide him no longer",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She made a basket of papyrus",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coated with tar and pitch",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid the child in it gently",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set it among the reeds on the Nile",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His sister stood at a distance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Watching to see what would be",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh's daughter came to the river",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To bathe by the water's edge",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She saw the basket in the reeds",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sent her slave girl to fetch it",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She made a basket of papyrus",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coated with tar and pitch",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid the child in it gently",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set it among the reeds on the Nile",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She opened it and saw the boy",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crying, a baby boy",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She felt sorry for him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Said this is one of the Hebrew children",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His sister asked to find a nurse",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A Hebrew woman to help",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh's daughter agreed and said",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go, find her and bring her here",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jochebed came and took the child",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nursed him for wages paid",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She made a basket of papyrus",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coated with tar and pitch",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid the child in it gently",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set it among the reeds on the Nile",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By faith his parents hid him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not afraid of the king's edict",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A faithful mother of Levi",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saw the beauty of God's plan",
